+	/* pagefeather lazy bodies (#582 M2a): the head must end exactly where the body starts. A mismatch never
+	 * bails (ACCEL_LOG_ERROR calls zend_bailout): it is logged as a WARNING, counted, and the script is stored
+	 * unsplit (pf_body_size 0), so a lazy load never uses a misaligned body. Then ZCG(mem) moves to the true
